#. Title of the desktop notification fired when the daemon detects a missing/expired Proton Drive session.
#: daemon/src/notification.rs:0
msgid "Proton Drive: authentication required"
msgstr "Proton Drive: प्रमाणीकरण आवश्यक है"

#. Body of the desktop notification fired when the daemon detects a missing/expired Proton Drive session.
#: daemon/src/notification.rs:0
msgid "Run \"proton-drive auth login\" in a terminal, then Proton Drive sync will resume automatically."
msgstr "टर्मिनल में \"proton-drive auth login\" चलाएँ, फिर Proton Drive सिंक अपने आप फिर से शुरू हो जाएगा।"

#. Title of the desktop notification fired when the daemon detects (via its own release-manifest check, not the CLI's self-report) that a newer proton-drive CLI release exists — see version_check.rs.
#: daemon/src/notification.rs:0
msgid "Proton Drive: CLI update available"
msgstr "Proton Drive: CLI अपडेट उपलब्ध है"

#. First half of the CLI-update-available notification body, followed by the new version number (see notification.rs's cli_update_available).
#: daemon/src/notification.rs:0
msgid "A newer version of the Proton Drive CLI is available:"
msgstr "Proton Drive CLI का एक नया संस्करण उपलब्ध है:"

#. Second half of the CLI-update-available notification body, followed by the installed version number.
#: daemon/src/notification.rs:0
msgid "You have"
msgstr "आपके पास है"

#. Body of the persistent notification shown while a pinned file downloads (see pin_started) — no percentage shown, since the CLI reports none.
#: daemon/src/notification.rs:0
msgid "Downloading to keep available offline…"
msgstr "ऑफ़लाइन उपलब्ध रखने के लिए डाउनलोड हो रहा है…"

#. Body of the notification replacing pin_started's once a pin succeeds.
#: daemon/src/notification.rs:0
msgid "Now available offline."
msgstr "अब ऑफ़लाइन उपलब्ध है।"

#. Prefix of the notification replacing pin_started's once a pin fails — the CLI's own error text is appended as-is, untranslated (same convention as the CLI-update-available notification's body).
#: daemon/src/notification.rs:0
msgid "Could not keep available offline:"
msgstr "ऑफ़लाइन उपलब्ध नहीं रखा जा सका:"
